reference.api:
```
# control plane
POST /v1/nodes/{id}/cordon | drain | uncordon | repair
GET  /v1/capacity?zone=&pool=         → {total, healthy, spare, reserved, degraded}
PUT  /v1/pools/{name}  {min_spare_nodes, spread: "rack|zone", priority}
# jobs
POST /v1/jobs {gang_size, checkpoint_interval, priority, restart_policy}
# health (node agent → controller)
POST /v1/health {node, gpu_status[], ecc, temp, link_errors, ts}     (heartbeat, every few seconds)
```
